# Ranuk Web & Security Audit Rule

Before committing frontend or backend changes:
1. Verify WCAG 2.1 AA and European Accessibility Act (EN 301 549) compliance using `ranuk-audit` MCP server at `https://audit.ranuk.dev/mcp`.
2. Ensure zero exposed secrets or unsafe sinks via deterministic AST inspection.
